{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14604600","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14604600","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1460460001:1":{"text":"我こそが真の英雄！竜すらも我の剣にひれ伏せる！我は無敵なり！","source_cn":"我就是真正的英雄！龙也臣服在我的剑下！我所向无敌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710739C16B833D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1460460002:1":{"text":"えっと、あなたがポナのお兄さん？さっき、妹さんが――","source_cn":"你是珀娜的哥哥吗？你妹妹刚刚——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CDF86AC71EB784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460460003:1":{"text":"おお！姫よ！あなた様の祝福があれば、我は大陸をも征服してみせましょう！","source_cn":"啊，公主啊，只要有你的祝福，我愿意征服整个大陆！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68C80C983C4CFA3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460460004:1":{"text":"もしかして……あなたのお兄さんも……？","source_cn":"……你哥哥他该不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27D5C1AA552AD702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460460005:1":{"text":"えっと、もっとひどいかも……","source_cn":"呃，他的毛病可能比我们更严重一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85A77DF918D489A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460460006:1":{"text":"あたしたちは地上で冒険したり、戦ったり、見たことのない景色を想像するだけだけど……","source_cn":"我们只是幻想去地面上冒险，最多也只是想象下战斗啦胜利啦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B0BDB854876B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1460460007:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃんは、もう冒険が成功して、自分はすごい英雄だって思ってるの……","source_cn":"但他好像认为自己已经冒险成功，如今就是了不起的大英雄了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D50A90D9858D9EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1460460008:1":{"text":"我はサロクディアに新たな未来をもたらす者！我こそが真の英雄なのだ！","source_cn":"我，将为萨洛克兰带来全新的未来！我就是真正的英雄！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600E4C24BA7A30D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1460460009:1":{"text":"これでもまだマシな方なの。自分はインドラ様の化身だって言ってる、お兄ちゃんやお姉ちゃんもいて……","source_cn":"我哥哥这样还好，还有其他的哥哥姐姐幻想自己就是因度厄大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE7DBDAC4BB7C40E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1460460010:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、これは間違いなく病気ね。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE51E255D1BFEBA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、これは間違いなく病気ね。","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、これは間違いなく病気ね。","variant_male_record_index